00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.280
What's going on? What's happening?

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:55.020
Mr. Talbot, you are under arrest. You have the right to remain silent.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.770
Everything you say will be held against you in front of the court.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:20:59.920
You...

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:20.640
- Oh, I love it, sir.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.490
- David 31, David 1, please advise me.

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:26.090
Part of home, it's a suspect in this vehicle.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:26.820
- Oh, Lord.

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:38.300
I have good news for you, Mr. Talbot.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:41.380
You, who are a fervent supporter of the capital punishment,

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:44.120
will certainly appreciate learning that the Legislative Council

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.060
has just reestablished the death penalty in our state.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.480
Would you like to pull the trigger yourself this time?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:48.940
Yeah!

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:54.770
Governor Adler.

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:58.070
Listen, delay that a little more, delay that, nothing but tectonics.

00:21:58.570 --> 00:22:00.000
That's all I'm asking, that's all, nothing more.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.600
Shit ! I'm talking to the others !

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:05.870
But you know me !

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:08.020
You know me, damn it !

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:10.050
I worked here before, for God's sake !

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.840
I'll tell you what to do.

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:15.270
And finally, after, wait !

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:17.270
He won't tell me what I did for him, he won't tell me what I did for him !

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:19.270
Fucking bastard, I explained everything to him !

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.270
All the dirty work, it's me who made him do it !

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.270
Do you hear what I'm saying ?

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:25.380
You're going to let me go from here, you bunch of smokers !

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:27.560
The phone is going to ring.

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:35.940
And I tell you, he will call, he will call I do not know!

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:39.940
And if you put the game before he passes his f*cking shot of life, you will all be fired you assholes!

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:42.340
Do you understand?

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:45.120
Band of bastards!

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:47.090
I always did what you asked me!

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:49.620
I never did anything that did not please you!

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:54.120
All I did is something that you were too soft to do yourself!

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:58.160
You are just a bunch of bastards, a wet hen!

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.420
At that!

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.980
Miles, I'm really sad to be here.

00:23:36.530 --> 00:23:42.260
It's my job.

00:23:42.260 --> 00:23:47.310
That's why I did that, because it's my job.

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:50.450
A man must be good at his job.

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:52.950
Otherwise, I would be dead.

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:56.100
- Avoid me, sir. - Why else would I be dead?

00:23:56.100 --> 00:23:57.420
- Waste effort. - Waste effort.

00:23:57.420 --> 00:24:00.000
- Waste effort. - Wash me completely of my fault and your treachery.

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:05.220
Purify me, for I know my debts, and my sin is constantly before me.

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:09.820
Forgive me, Lord, it is against you alone that I sinned, and I did what was wrong in my eyes,

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:13.620
so that you are just when you disobey, so that you are without sin when you swear.

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:30.000
Deliver me from the blood, oh Lord, cover me with your blood.

00:24:37.770 --> 00:24:44.880
I didn't want them to cut my hair, they said it was a mistake because my skull could catch fire when they electrocuted me.

00:24:44.880 --> 00:24:49.330
I told them not to do it, the governor will call.

00:25:00.280 --> 00:25:05.130
Lord of Heavens, what a disgrace against nature!

00:25:05.130 --> 00:25:09.210
What a revenge for this poor Talbot!

00:25:09.210 --> 00:25:15.700
This is to show you what happens when you are too conscientious in your work.

00:25:23.730 --> 00:25:26.740
But don't worry about him. After all, he didn't steal.

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:30.000
He stole what happened to him!

00:25:30.380 --> 00:25:34.550
So, first of all, little boy and little girl...

00:25:34.550 --> 00:25:41.650
Safety first!
